### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@leadId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api

### 3. Create a Lead (Full Detail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Johnson",
  "phone": "+1-555-0199",
  "service": "Ceramic Coating",
  "source": "website",
  "status": "new"
}

### 4. Create a Second Lead (Interior Detail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "David Miller",
  "phone": "+1-555-8833",
  "service": "Full Detail",
  "source": "instagram"
}

### 5. Get All Leads (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?page=1&limit=10

### 6. Filter Leads by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?status=new

### 7. Search Leads by Name or Phone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?search=Alex

### 8. Get Single Lead by ID
# Replace {{leadId}} with a real UUID returned from POST /api/leads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}

### 9. Update Lead Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "scheduled"
}

### 10. Delete Lead by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}

### 11. Test Validation Error (Missing required fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A"
}
